The Angelic Toilet is a hidden [[Enemies|Toilet]] that has not been used in the game, it has recently been added to the game after an update. It has 286 HP. it also stuns. 

== Appearance ==
The Angelic Toilet has a white toilet, a halo and a grey torso.

== Waves ==
This unit spawns only in Drill World Easy, Drill World Hard and Halloween Graveyard 2024. 

== Strategy ==
The '''Angelic Toilet''' is a very easy [[Enemies|enemy]] to defeat, being both low health and kind of slow. Any unit can be used to defeat this enemy except for money troops.

== Trivia ==

* This enemy is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Saint_Skibidi_Toilet Saint Skibidi Toilet] from the Skibidi Toilet Series.
* The Angelic Toilet was discovered by a Youtuber Name '''Hoplas2.'''

